  "measurement_note": "Size is n, the common length of s and t. Tiers 16, 64, and 256 span 16x. Each pair agrees for n - 1 characters and differs at the final character, so the accepted two-pointer implementation scans once in O(n). A correct implementation that removes every possible source character and recomputes the common prefix for each candidate is quadratic, must return n - 1 at every tier, and must fail scaling.",
